  "answer_text": "For each hour on December 8, 2025, the location with the highest average crowd size was generally \"KeynoteHall_Stage\" during the early and late hours. Notably, \"KeynoteHall_Stage\" had the highest average crowd at 09:00 with 450.19 and again at 14:00 with 399.51. During mid-morning to afternoon, \"ExpoFloor_MainAisle\" was the most crowded at 10:00 and 11:00 with averages around 179, and at 15:00 with 160.01. In the early afternoon (12:00) and evening (17:00 and 18:00), \"FoodCourt_North\" saw the largest crowds with averages peaking at 120.05.",
